WEBVTT

00:10:58.436 --> 00:11:00.956
they came together
and started a land trust

00:11:00.996 --> 00:11:04.076
to protect their community
from gentrification

00:11:04.076 --> 00:11:08.076
due to rising sea levels
and flooding in other parts of the city.

00:11:08.396 --> 00:11:10.436
In Portland, Oregon,

00:11:10.476 --> 00:11:12.316
communities came together

00:11:12.356 --> 00:11:15.756
and passed a corporate Clean Energy Tax.

00:11:16.236 --> 00:11:20.996
This tax will fund
tens of millions of dollars

00:11:21.036 --> 00:11:23.276
into green jobs and healthy homes.

00:11:24.356 --> 00:11:29.076
I'm saying these are just a handful
of the innovative, creative solutions

00:11:29.116 --> 00:11:33.076
that are healing and transforming
communities right now, today.